    "text": "City: London\n\nA hyper-realistic macro photograph of a unique ceramic mug that blends formal function with elaborate artistic sculpture, designed as a tribute to a vibrant city. The upper third and rim of the mug are smooth, polished, and cylindrical, designed comfortably for…",
